{"number":109,"nameArabic":"الكافرون","nameTransliterated":"Al-Kafirun","nameTranslated":"The Disbelievers","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":6,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"109:1","textAr":"قُلۡ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"Qul ya ayyuha alkafiroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Say, \"O disbelievers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہہ دو کہ اے کافرو"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"109:2","textAr":"لَآ أَعۡبُدُ مَا تَعۡبُدُونَ","transliteration":"La aAAbudu ma taAAbudoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"I do not worship what you worship"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"میں اُن کی عبادت نہیں کرتا جن کی عبادت تم کرتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"109:3","textAr":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Nor are you worshippers of what I worship"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نہ تم اُس کی عبادت کرنے والے ہو جس کی عبادت میں کرتا ہوں"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"109:4","textAr":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٞ مَّا عَبَدتُّمۡ","transliteration":"Wala ana AAabidun ma AAabadtum","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Nor will I be a worshipper of what you worship"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نہ میں اُن کی عبادت کرنے والا ہوں جن کی عبادت تم نے کی ہے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"109:5","textAr":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Nor will you be worshippers of what I worship"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نہ تم اُس کی عبادت کرنے والے ہو جس کی عبادت میں کرتا ہوں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"109:6","textAr":"لَكُمۡ دِينُكُمۡ وَلِيَ دِينِ","transliteration":"Lakum deenukum waliya deeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارے لیے تمہارا دین ہے اور میرے لیے میرا دین"}]}]}